 "body": "## wp1236 A r12 G2\n\nImplements Batch A only under the successor Codex lease. Exact head 835655b6b5d8ad2add49f04ded92d3fd3f42515e.\n\n- [Batch A spec and lease context](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1236#issuecomment-7082537558)\n- [Whole-packet AGY offline approval](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1236#issuecomment-7125514979)\n- [Owner E5 audit and conditional merge authorization](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/1236#issuecomment-7107992503)\n\nLinux selftest 1784/1784. Windows exact-head and baseline both 1783/1784 with the same pre-existing fixture failure. Batch A feature gates passed on Linux and Windows. Pinned Rule 9 scan completed and AGY adjudicated all 23 survivors equivalent. This successor PR carries the executor branch identified in the G2 lease. Prior draft #1480 is the G1 starting point.",
